{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wanglou-e-0a03e713b575803117a6","title":"皓以为曜不承用诏命意不忠荩，积前后嫌忿，收曜付狱","accounts":[{"id":"wanglou-a-0a03e713b575803117a6","label":"正文","text":"皓以为曜不承用诏命意不忠荩，积前后嫌忿，收曜付狱","evidence":["wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","wanglou-q-8b70d580329ba8745ee7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"收狱","evidence":["wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","wanglou-q-8b70d580329ba8745ee7"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0049","role":"被收","evidence":["wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","wanglou-q-8b70d580329ba8745ee7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"凤凰二年","precision":"undated","basis":"原文紧接“是岁”明确系前事；保留纪年而不推公元年。","evidence":["wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","wanglou-q-8b70d580329ba8745ee7"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","order":11121}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0049","name":"韦曜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0162","name":"孙皓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wanglou-q-32b78210340f4d8fd36e","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-b8b2dbec2d407e815402","layer":"original","quote":"曜益忧惧，自陈衰老，求去侍、史二官；乞欲成所造书〖13〗，以后业别有所付〖14〗：皓终不听。时有疾病，医药监护，持之愈急〖15〗。皓每飨宴，无不竟日。坐席无能否，率以七升为限〖16〗；虽不悉入口，皆浇灌取尽。曜素饮酒不过二升。初见礼异时〖17〗，常为裁减，或密赐茶荈以当酒〖18〗。至于宠衰，更见逼强，辄以为罪。又于酒后，使侍臣难折公卿〖19〗，以嘲弄侵克〖20〗，发擿私短以为欢〖21〗。时有愆过，或误犯皓讳，辄见收缚，至于诛戮。曜以为外相毁伤，内长尤恨〖22〗，使不济济〖23〗，非佳事也；故但示难问经义言论而已〖24〗。皓以为不承用诏命，意不忠荩；遂积前后嫌忿，收曜付狱。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":289},{"id":"wanglou-q-8b70d580329ba8745ee7","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-43c9c6599361c1628957","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，凤凰二年也。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
